    LLM: 'Game: Tarot of the Abbé de Marolles 1637. Three players, 66 cards. Declarations then tricks; follow suit, must play trump if cannot follow; Fool excuses; Tarots and Ultimo pay marques; card points above/below 25 settle winner/losers.',
    Player: 'Three-player Tarot from 1637: declare combinations for marques, follow suit, play trumps when unable to follow, excuse the Fool before the last trick; Ultimo and card points determine payments.',
