      equipment: 'Tarot pack, counters (marques).',
      dealing: "Dealer shuffles; player to dealer's left cuts (cut card shown; if it is a Tarot, dealer receives one marque from each opponent). Dealer deals 4 rounds of 5 cards to each player, then one more card to each other player and 4 to himself: non-dealers receive 21 cards each, dealer 24. The two non-dealers each discard one card and the dealer discards four; no trumps or Tarots may be discarded (penalty: two marques to each opponent). Discards count in the discarder's favour at end of play.",
    },
