          deckDescription: 'A 66-card Tarot de Marseille pack with 21 trumps plus the Fool and 44 Latin-suited cards. Swords and Batons keep King, Queen, Cavalier, Jack, 10 down to 4; Cups and Coins keep King, Queen, Cavalier, Jack, Ace down to 7.',
          suitDescription: 'Swords and Batons are the long suits; Cups and Coins are the round suits. The round and long suits keep different pip ranges in the reduced 66-card pack.',
          rankDescription: 'Courts are King, Queen, Cavalier, and Jack. Long suits use 10 to 4 as their pips; round suits use Ace to 7 as their pips.',
          dealPattern: 'Four rounds of 5 cards to each player, then one card to each other player and four to dealer; non-dealers receive 21 cards, dealer 24. Non-dealers discard one each, dealer discards four.',
